Fix the version string, which upstream left at 0.14 in the 0.15 tag.

pyproject.toml declares the version as dynamic, so flit takes it from
bugz.__version__.  Without this the 0.15 tree builds a pybugz-0.14 wheel
and the dist-info directory does not match the package version.

Upstream tags the releases by hand; this should be reported there so the
next bump needs no patch.

---
pybugz-0.15/bugz/__init__.py | 2 +-
1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

Index: pybugz-0.15/bugz/__init__.py
===================================================================
--- pybugz-0.15.orig/bugz/__init__.py
+++ pybugz-0.15/bugz/__init__.py
@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@
-__version__ = '0.14'
+__version__ = '0.15'
 __license__ = """Copyright (c) 2006, Alastair Tse, All rights reserved.
 This following source code is licensed under the GPL v2 License."""
